 "words": 173,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "I am always with you held by your hand",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Guided by counsel toward the promised land",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the heaven above I have no one else",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "On the earth below you are my wealth",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My flesh and my heart may fail",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But God is the rock of my heart",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My portion forever remains",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The strength within my frail",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Those who are far from you will perish",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Destroying all who are unfaithful",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But as for me it is good to be near",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Refuge in the Lord I find",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My flesh and my heart may fail",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But God is the rock of my heart",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My portion forever remains",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The strength within my frail",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I tell of all your works with joy",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Near God my spirit finds its home",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No fear remains when I am close",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your light upon the world is shown",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My flesh and my heart may fail",
   "heard": 7,
